also engages in the sale of tickets for performance project. Further, it provides project management services. The company was founded in 1971 and is headquartered in Malacca, Malaysia.","zh":"Yong Tai Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚从事旅游相关房地产开发业务，成立于1971年，总部位于马来西亚马六甲。公司业务分为房地产开发、房地产投资与旅游、酒店与资产优化三个板块。","lines":["房地产开发：开发住宅和商业物业，面向购房者和商业客户。","房地产投资与旅游：投资物业，并从事演出项目门票销售。","酒店与资产优化：通过该板块开展酒店相关业务及资产优化。","项目管理服务：提供项目管理服务。"],"lines_en":["Property Development: develops residential and commercial properties for homebuyers and commercial clients.","Property Investment & Tourism: invests in properties and sells tickets for performance projects.","Hospitality & Asset Optimisation: operates under this segment for hospitality-related activities and asset optimisation.","Project Management Services: provides project management services."]}}